{emailSubject}Incomplete reviews{/emailSubject}
<h1>Some of the code reviews in your groups have not yet been closed!</h1>

<p>
    The following solutions have opened reviews. Please note that a solution author will not see
    the review comments until the review is closed.
</p>

<table role="presentation" class="facts" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
    <tr n:foreach="$solutions as $solution">
        <td class="k"><a href="{$solution->solutionUrl}">solution #{$solution->attempt}</a></td>
        <td class="v">
            <a href="{$solution->assignmentUrl}">{$solution->assignment}</a><br>
            <span class="quiet">{$solution->group} · submitted at {$solution->submitted|localizedDate:'en'}</span>
        </td>
    </tr>
</table>
